\[P(n,n_{pp},k)=\begin{pmatrix}n+k+1\\ k-1\end{pmatrix}\left(\frac{n_{pp}/k}{1+n_{pp}/k}\right)^{n}\left(\frac{1}{1+n_{ pp}/k}\right)^{k} \tag{5.3}\]

